262	     * {@code FY} segment carried by the owner's {@link #getMemberId() member id}, e.g.
263	     * {@code "FY26"}. Derived on read from the member id, falling back to the owner's live
264	     * {@link #registrationDate} until a member id has been assigned; {@code null} until
265	     * either is available.
266	     */
